    {
      "title": "Multimodal Prompting Tips and Common Mistakes",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Multimodal Prompting Tips and Common Mistakes",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Prompt Layout",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Image ==first==, then the question: 'in the chart above'",
                "Several images: label them ==Image 1==, ==Image 2==",
                "Ask for ==JSON fields==, a table, or transcribe-then-answer, not 'describe this'"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "text",
              "lines": [
                "Image 1: [sales chart]",
                "Transcribe the axis labels, then answer.",
                "Reply as JSON: {\"peak_month\": str}"
              ],
              "note": "label, transcribe, structured output"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Resolution and Cost",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Problem",
                "Fix"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Small text, thin lines, dense tables",
                  "==Crop or tile== the region"
                ],
                [
                  "Many tokens, cost, latency",
                  "==Resize== to needed detail"
                ],
                [
                  "Exact characters matter",
                  "==OCR first==, then the VLM"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Common Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "VLMs hallucinate: ==verify== counts, spatial relations, fine reading",
                "Image generation: not 'don't mention X', use a ==negative prompt==",
                "STT: check ==sample rate== and noise first"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Chart hallucination?** Crop, transcribe values first, then verify",
                "**OCR before a VLM?** Text-heavy docs needing exact characters",
                "**Resolution and cost?** More patches mean more tokens"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Multimodal Cheat Sheet",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 5,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Multimodal Cheat Sheet",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Vision and CLIP",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Item",
                "Rule"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Patch tokens",
                  "==(H/P) x (W/P)=="
                ],
                [
                  "VLM",
                  "vision encoder + projector + LLM"
                ],
                [
                  "CLIP",
                  "contrastive loss on **NxN** similarity matrix, learned temperature"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Diffusion",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Forward: ==add noise==; reverse: **predict noise**",
                "Latent diffusion denoises in a ==VAE== latent",
                "Text enters by ==cross-attention==",
                "Higher guidance scale: better prompt fit, less diversity"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Speech and Prompting",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Pipeline",
                "Key fact"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "ASR",
                  "log-mel → encoder-decoder (Whisper)",
                  "16 kHz, 30 s windows, ==WER=="
                ],
                [
                  "TTS",
                  "acoustic model → vocoder",
                  "vocoder makes the waveform"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Put the ==image first==; label multiple images",
                "==Crop== for fine detail",
                "Request **structured output**",
                "Verify counts and fine reading"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Single ASR metric?** ==WER==",
                "**Diffusion target?** the added noise (MSE)",
                "**CLIP loss?** symmetric cross-entropy over the NxN matrix",
                "**Cut image token cost?** resize or crop, or OCR first"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
